			"notes": "## Hydration datapack support for 8 mods\n\nAdds live Thirst hydration data for drinks (and a few related foods) from eight optional mods, as a pure JSON datapack — no compile-time dependency on any of them:\n\n- Farmer's Delight Refabricated\n- HerbalBrews\n- Vinery\n- Meadow\n- Farm & Charm\n- Bakery (Pudding Slice only — no dedicated beverages exist)\n- Candlelight\n- Brewery (covers both bottled drinks and keg/tap blocks)\n\nSee [Mod Compatibility](https://github.com/Atlasroar/LegendarySurvivalOverhaul/wiki/Mod-Compatibility) for full item coverage per mod.\n\n```text\nlegendarysurvivaloverhaul-fabric-1.20.1-2.8.0.jar\nSHA-256: BF009EF73F41F572A162BF9DDA0EC2785DD8E1904713407E5ED30E7978ABF46A\n```"
		},
