			"notes": "Fixes the Left Shift hijack for players upgrading from pre-2.6.3 builds. v2.6.3 unbound the added_desc tooltip keybind's default, but Minecraft persists bound keys by name in options.txt, so already-saved installs kept the old Left Shift binding regardless of the new default. This release adds a one-time client-side migration that detects a saved added_desc binding still on Left Shift, clears it, and resaves options.txt, so vanilla sneak and other keybinds sharing Shift work again without manually rebinding in Controls."
		},
